<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-13T21:23:52.885Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:23:52 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian security forces have stepped up anti-ISIS raids, pursued former regime loyalists, and employed private security firms linked to a new Syrian security mogul while foiling drug-smuggling attempts on the Iraq and Jordan borders. Israeli drones struck a Syrian operative planning attacks for Iran near the Lebanon border, prompting the UN Security Council to call on Israel to respect the 1974 Disengagement Agreement. In central Syria, three road security personnel were killed in an attack in Hama, and Syria accused Israel of arming and funding militias in Suwayda to sow chaos. 2,732 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxPYWNzM3pVdGJlSGtkQzl4TGVPelNIMGFtQnpBbjl3bFNDQkV6bWx6a0hDYVZnaEsyX3ViSkpyRVVCQ3dUanF2ejBBVnBSQThTS0IxNkxfZ3JtUkU3T1BfSkE3Z05pQ3l1TlhGTS1NdTFjbWZ3RjZzLXBDb3QtNGd2WkhXVEd1UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNV0NQb1VNY2ZISGtPR0hkUlo0a2dqeXBzd2VBc2hlZnhiNWlKWmxuXzlweU5yaUtUQldGVzN4VkIzWjA0cHZQYmNITHNSenBOTG1WdlJJZGc2WjZiQlc2R09wRHdtelpiNUtBOVJHWWp2S2oxckZuMnNIMU9CY0JSSnpyVG53RmVjT1BqLUFzdGVidHRLZTgyV3RXS3R5Uy0tZGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQSjg4LW9RVFVLY2UtUFpiNVRLbkU4bHQ1WlNFcllrQWZCcWdxWmdIM2s5S3NpbXgweDVpeXY3WTVwWEZFbVVaclcyWjZmSmZlbW9kSnZJSnU5ZHRBUkFfeGJGZTZqWjdCNnc1Vm5kU2pRU3NrU2c2eVI3SVQ1b0NsSUtUclBFcW5RM1pFWUJBWUphWGM?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/